[00:37.51] To live between a rock
[00:38.93] And a hard place
[00:40.66] In between time --
[00:43.85] Cruising in prime time --
[00:45.85] Soaking up the cathode rays
[00:49.60] To live between the wars
[00:51.76] In our time --
[00:53.90] Living in real time --
[00:56.79] Holding the good time --
[00:59.16] Holding on to yesterdays...
[01:03.24] 
[01:10.49] You know how that rabbit feels
[01:12.28] Going under your speeding wheels
[01:16.23] Bright images flashing by
[01:19.02] Like windshields towards a fly
[01:23.47] Frozen in the fatal climb --
[01:25.36] But the wheels of time --
[01:27.84] Just pass you by...
[01:31.40] 
[01:35.96] Wheels can take you around
[01:39.21] Wheels can cut you down
[01:42.36] We can go from boom to bust
[01:45.58] From dreams to a bowl of dust
[01:48.56] We can fall from rockets' red glare
[01:52.05] Down to "Brother can you spare --"
[01:54.53] Another war -- another waste land --
[01:58.64] And another lost generation...
[02:04.80] 
[02:17.50] It slips between your hands
[02:19.18] Like water
[02:19.84] This living in real time
[02:23.09] A dizzying lifetime
[02:25.73] Reeling by on celluloid
[02:30.08] Struck between the eyes
[02:31.51] By the big-time world
[02:34.56] Walking uneasy streets --
[02:37.85] Hiding beneath the sheets --
[02:39.36] Got to try and fill the void...
